# JobPilot works with no .env file at all.
#
# Everything a normal user needs — which AI writes for you, any API key, your
# Gmail details, which job boards are on — is set inside the app (Settings) and
# stored in your data folder, not here. This file is only for people who prefer
# environment variables, or who need to change how the app starts.
#
# Copy to .env and uncomment what you want.

# ------------------------------------------------------------- the AI writer
# You need none of these if you use the "Claude subscription (no API key)"
# option, which routes through the locally installed Claude Code CLI signed in
# to your own Claude Pro/Max account. You also need none of them if you paste a
# key into Settings instead — that is the normal way.
# GROQ_API_KEY=
# OPENAI_API_KEY=
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# Note: the Claude Code CLI would normally prefer ANTHROPIC_API_KEY over your
# subscription login. JobPilot strips it from the CLI's environment so the
# "no API key" provider really does stay off per-token billing — but if you
# want to be certain of that, leave it unset.

# Where the Claude Code CLI lives, if it is not on PATH and not in one of the
# usual places (~/.local/bin, /opt/homebrew/bin, /usr/local/bin).
# CLAUDE_CLI_PATH=/path/to/claude

# The model is set in Settings → The writer, not here. Leaving it empty picks
# a sensible default per provider.

# ----------------------------------------------------------------- the server
# PORT=4310

# Your data folder. Defaults to ~/JobPilotData. It is fully portable: copy it
# to another computer, start JobPilot there, and everything is back.
# JOBPILOT_DATA=

# Network binding: the app binds to 127.0.0.1 (this computer only) by default.
# Opt in to LAN access — reachable by other devices on your network — with
# either of these. A warning is logged whenever LAN mode is on. Only do it on a
# network you trust: anyone who can reach the app can read your CV, change your
# settings and send email from your Gmail.
# HOST=0.0.0.0
# JOBPILOT_LAN=1

# ------------------------------------------------------------- the launcher
# Start the server but don't open a browser (headless boxes, CI).
# JOBPILOT_NO_BROWSER=1
# Don't generate JobPilot.app on macOS.
# JOBPILOT_NO_APP=1

# Apify (LinkedIn / Naukri), Adzuna and your Gmail details are NOT read from
# this file. Set them in Settings → Advanced inside the app.
